# Reply analysis backend. Set ONE key, or none at all.
# With no key the bot uses its built-in lexicon and runs fully offline.
#
# Groq     — free tier, no card, ~30 req/min and up to 14,400 req/day on
#            openai/gpt-oss-20b (~1000 tok/s). Good default for a demo.
#            NOTE: llama-3.1-8b-instant and llama-3.3-70b-versatile were
#            shut down for free/dev tiers on 2026-08-16. Do not use them.
# Gemini   — free tier, no card, ~15 req/min and ~1,500 req/day on Flash.
#            NOTE: Google's free tier permits training on submitted prompts.
#            These replies contain health and harassment disclosures, so treat
#            free-tier Gemini as demo-only.
# Anthropic— starter credits then paid; a 30-conversation day costs a few cents.

GROQ_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides
# VIBEBOT_PROVIDER=groq          # force one when several keys are present
# VIBEBOT_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
